  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICSP Climate 02 2025 - re-coding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2025, Christian Aid Ireland (CAI) made a successful application to the 2025 Climate Adaptation and Mitigation Project Call for proposals. Given it&#x2019;s demonstrated capacity to deliver climate adaptation programmes, it was awarded funding of &#x20ac;1,000,000 for the period 1 November 2025 to 31 December 2027. The funding will be disbursed on the basis of a contract that outlines the terms and conditions for use of the grant and is legally binding. This grant will also be subject to the commitment and the principles underpinning the partnership between the Department and Christian Aid Ireland set out in the 2023 Ireland&#x2019;s Civil Society Partnership for A Better World (ICSP) Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) covering the period 2023 to 2027.</narrative>
  </description>
